<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex buy reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telmex buy reiterated.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers reiterated its buy rating on Mexican telephone company Telefonos de Mexico SA (Telmex), the brokerage said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Analyst Sari Mayer said Telmex has fared well in the long-distance pre-subscription process. The analyst also said new rates in the competitive market do not appear to be leading to a price war.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
